<title>USA: Primadonna sees NY, NY cash flow at $90 mln.</title>
<headline>Primadonna sees NY, NY cash flow at $90 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Primadonna Resorts Inc Chief Financial Officer Craig Sulllivan said the company expects first year cash flow at the New York, New York hotel casino in Las Vegas to be about $90 million.</p>
<p>That amount would be split evenly between Primadonna and MGM Grand Inc, its 50 percent partner in the new resort that is set to open on January 3.</p>
<p>Cash flow, or Earnings Before Interest Taxes Depreciation and Amortization (EBITDA), is a common benchmark for financial success in the gambling industry.</p>
</text>
